    "content": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">Innovation Title:<br /></b>Self Sanitizing Door Handle With Protective Cover</p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff51f58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ff51f58\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">Name & Age of Inventors (at the time of innovation):<br /></b>Maleeha Khan (16)<br />Imaan Moosa (16)<br />Inaya Sheikh (16)<br />Mahum Rana (16)<br />Laiba Mehmood (16)<br />Ayaan Mehmood (16)<br />Aamena Baig (14)<br />Ayesha Baig (14)<br />Deen Sheikh (15)</p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c316104 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c316104\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>Problem Statement:</b></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Door handles collect thousands of harmful microbes daily, making them major hotspots for spreading disease.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>A 2014 University of Arizona study showed that when a virus sample was applied to door handles, within just 2–4 hours the virus was picked up by 40 to 60 percent of workers and visitors in the facilities. Manual cleaning is often inconsistent, impractical, and skipped—especially in public or high-traffic spaces—leaving people exposed to harmful bacteria and viruses without warning. This exposes people to harmful bacteria and viruses without warning. </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3d6a36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3d6a36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>About the Innovation:</b></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"color: #339966;\"><strong>This team of young inventors at DiscoverSTEM innovated a self-powered, self-sanitizing door handle that disinfects itself with every use.</strong></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>A hollow glass shell houses UV-C lights on an internal rod, powered by a spring-and-turbine system activated when the door moves. Protective connectors ensure safe radiation, while sensors and LED indicators show status. It delivers safe, automatic, and continuous handle sanitization without external power or manual cleaning.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3d6a36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3d6a36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>Patent Certificate:<br /></b></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2259 size-large\" src=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Patent-30-door-handle-min-1024x674.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"487\" srcset=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Patent-30-door-handle-min-1024x674.png 1024w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Patent-30-door-handle-min-300x197.png 300w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Patent-30-door-handle-min-768x505.png 768w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Patent-30-door-handle-min-1536x1011.png 1536w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Patent-30-door-handle-min.png 1900w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 740px) 100vw, 740px\" /></p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-abf0979 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"abf0979\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>US Patent Grant Date:<br /></b>September 16, 2025</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9db1b4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9db1b4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>United States Patent Number:<br /></b>12415005</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9536474 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9536474\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">To Read Patent Details:</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-adf2ee8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"adf2ee8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p>Click Here <a href=\"https://ppubs.uspto.gov/external/print/pdfRedirectDownload/20240144357\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">USPTO</a> | <a href=\"https://patents.google.com/patent/US20220387639A1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Patents</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<p></p>\n"
