    "content": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">Innovation Title:<br /></b>Method and System For Providing A Smart Ladder To A User</p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff51f58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ff51f58\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">Name & Age of Inventors (at the time of innovation):<br /></b>Shayaan Shaik (10)<br />Aqil Gudur (12)<br />Zashaan T Shaik (12)<br />Gupil Mayari (12)<br />Omar Mohammed (12)<br />Suleman Khan Mohammed (10)<br />Humna Fakeha Khan (13)<br />Abdullah Hasani (17)<br />Mishaal Qureshi (17)<br />Zaynab Khan (17)</p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c316104 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c316104\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>Problem Statement:</b></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A 2020 study shows that nearly 49% of individuals who fell stepladders suffered fractures, including hip fractures.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Falls from stepladders are not only common but also result in severe injuries, causing significant pain, medical expenses, and potential long-term health complications for the affected individuals. </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3d6a36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3d6a36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>About the Innovation:</b></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"color: #339966;\"><strong>This team of young inventors from DiscoverSTEM designed a smart ladder that detects imbalance.</strong></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>This smart ladder detects if there is any probability of loss of balance and fall, and alerts the user about it. Further, if the user falls from the ladder, it opens up an airbag-type cushioning to prevent serious injury. <br />.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3d6a36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3d6a36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>Patent Certificate:<br /></b></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2258 size-large\" src=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Patent-31-smart-ladder-min-1024x674.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"487\" srcset=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Patent-31-smart-ladder-min-1024x674.png 1024w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Patent-31-smart-ladder-min-300x197.png 300w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Patent-31-smart-ladder-min-768x505.png 768w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Patent-31-smart-ladder-min-1536x1011.png 1536w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Patent-31-smart-ladder-min.png 1900w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 740px) 100vw, 740px\" /></p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-abf0979 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"abf0979\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>US Patent Grant Date:<br /></b>September 2, 2025</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9db1b4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9db1b4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>United States Patent Number:<br /></b>12404722</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9536474 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9536474\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">To Read Patent Details:</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-adf2ee8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"adf2ee8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p>Click Here <a href=\"https://ppubs.uspto.gov/external/print/pdfRedirectDownload/20230332468\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">USPTO</a> | <a href=\"https://patents.google.com/patent/US20230332468A1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Patents</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<p></p>\n",
    "videoUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/2XARH-JL5aw?feature=oembed"
