    "description": "Innovation Title: Apparatus to enable differently abled users to communicate and a method thereof Name & Age of Inventors (at the time of innovation): Yashas Vamsi Pradeep (16) Zayn Sohel Sachak (13) Gautam Rao (16) Hamza Ali Zakir (12) Sanjiv Sridharan (13) Sheza Asif (13) Iliyan Ali Mithani (8) Vihan Yerubandi (15) Nihal Yerubandi (10) [...]",
    "content": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">Innovation Title:<br />\n</b>Apparatus to enable differently abled users to communicate and a method thereof</p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff51f58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ff51f58\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">Name & Age of Inventors (at the time of innovation):<br />\n</b>Yashas Vamsi Pradeep (16)<br />\nZayn Sohel Sachak (13)<br />\nGautam Rao (16)<br />\nHamza Ali Zakir (12)<br />\nSanjiv Sridharan (13)<br />\nSheza Asif (13)<br />\nIliyan Ali Mithani (8)<br />\nVihan Yerubandi (15)<br />\nNihal Yerubandi (10)<br />\nAbdullah Ali Syed (11)<br />\nAvaneesh Jakkireddy (12)<br />\nRaj Kusumakar (10)<br />\nAbdullah Hasani (17)<br />\nMishaal Qureshi (17)</p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c316104 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c316104\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>Problem Statement:</b></p>\n<blockquote><p>This problem revolves around individuals afflicted with Amyotrophic Lateral Sclerosis (ALS).</p></blockquote>\n<p>It is a degenerative disease causing the loss of voluntary control over limbs, impaired breathing, and communication difficulties. ALS patients experience diminished quality of life and significant hurdles in daily living. The problem at its core is the urgent need for innovative solutions to assist and empower ALS patients in maintaining their independence and communication capabilities.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3d6a36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3d6a36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>About the Innovation:</b></p>\n<blockquote><p><span style=\"color: #339966;\"><strong>Young Inventors at DiscoverSTEM designed an intelligent system that tracks the eye movement of an ALS patient and converts it into complete sentences.</strong></span></p></blockquote>\n<p>The system consists of a wearable glass or contact lens which is tracked on a compartmentalized screen. Each compartment of the screen has an object or cue that directly relates to the daily needs of the patient. When the patient looks at an object, the system converts it to audio sentences and relays the message to the caregiver, thus making it easier for an ALS patient to communicate about their daily needs.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3d6a36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3d6a36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>Patent Certificate:<br />\n</b></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1734 size-large\" src=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-21-Diff-Abled-Comm-min-1024x674.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"674\" srcset=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-21-Diff-Abled-Comm-min-1024x674.jpg 1024w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-21-Diff-Abled-Comm-min-300x197.jpg 300w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-21-Diff-Abled-Comm-min-768x505.jpg 768w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-21-Diff-Abled-Comm-min-1536x1011.jpg 1536w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-21-Diff-Abled-Comm-min.jpg 1900w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-abf0979 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"abf0979\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>US Patent Grant Date:<br />\n</b>July 9, 2024</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9db1b4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9db1b4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>United States Patent Number:<br />\n</b>12032156</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9536474 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9536474\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">To Read Patent Details:</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-adf2ee8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"adf2ee8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p>Click Here <a href=\"https://image-ppubs.uspto.gov/dirsearch-public/print/downloadPdf/20230324680\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">USPTO</a> | <a href=\"https://patents.google.com/patent/US20230324680A1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Patents</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
