    "description": "Innovation Title: A System for Refilling of Used Markers Name & Age of Inventors (at the time of innovation): Maheen Rafique (11) Abdul Basit Piracha (13) Naveed Rauf (12) Ali Akbar Kayani (10) Meher Saanvi Singh (10) Jiya Saanvi Singh (8) Maya Ajlouni (7) Abdullah Mohiuddin (10) Hassan Saadi (11) Hiba Sheikh (12) Gibran Saleem [...]",
    "content": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">Innovation Title:<br />\n</b>A System for Refilling of Used Markers</p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff51f58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ff51f58\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">Name & Age of Inventors (at the time of innovation):<br />\n</b>Maheen Rafique (11)<br />\nAbdul Basit Piracha (13)<br />\nNaveed Rauf (12)<br />\nAli Akbar Kayani (10)<br />\nMeher Saanvi Singh (10)<br />\nJiya Saanvi Singh (8)<br />\nMaya Ajlouni (7)<br />\nAbdullah Mohiuddin (10)<br />\nHassan Saadi (11)<br />\nHiba Sheikh (12)<br />\nGibran Saleem (11)</p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c316104 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c316104\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>Problem Statement:</b></p>\n<blockquote><p>Disposable markers, made of hard plastic, are discarded after a single use, significantly contributing to environmental pollution and waste.</p></blockquote>\n<p>A user-friendly refill system is needed to make markers reusable, reducing waste and environmental harm.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3d6a36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3d6a36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>About the Innovation:</b></p>\n<blockquote><p><span style=\"color: #339966;\"><strong>Young Inventors at DiscoverSTEM developed  a system to refill used markers using centrifugal force.</strong></span></p></blockquote>\n<p>A motorized round plate holds an ink reservoir and a slot to insert the marker. The tip of the marker goes inside the ink reservoir. When the plate spins, ink is propelled through the tip by centrifugal force, refilling the marker quickly and mess-free. This efficient method minimizes waste, reduces environmental impact, and makes marker reuse easy.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3d6a36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3d6a36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>Patent Certificate:<br />\n</b></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1733 size-large\" src=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-20-System-for-refilling-of-used-markers-min-1024x674.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"674\" srcset=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-20-System-for-refilling-of-used-markers-min-1024x674.jpg 1024w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-20-System-for-refilling-of-used-markers-min-300x197.jpg 300w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-20-System-for-refilling-of-used-markers-min-768x505.jpg 768w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-20-System-for-refilling-of-used-markers-min-1536x1011.jpg 1536w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-20-System-for-refilling-of-used-markers-min.jpg 1900w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-abf0979 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"abf0979\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>US Patent Grant Date:<br />\n</b>April 23, 2024</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9db1b4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9db1b4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>United States Patent Number:<br />\n</b>11964508</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9536474 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9536474\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">To Read Patent Details:</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-adf2ee8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"adf2ee8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p>Click Here <a href=\"https://image-ppubs.uspto.gov/dirsearch-public/print/downloadPdf/20230060737\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">USPTO</a> | <a href=\"https://patents.google.com/patent/US20230060737A1/en?oq=US+20230060737+A1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Patents</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
