    "description": "Innovation Title: Smart shower head Name & Age of Inventors (at the time of innovation): Ameer Syedibrahim (15) Amjad Syedibrahim (15) Syed Shah Ekramullah Alvi (15) Sidra Ambreen (16) Hiba Khan (14) Zainab Khan (15) Problem Statement: Over 3 billion gallons of clean water are wasted annually in the USA as people wait for hot [...]",
    "content": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">Innovation Title:<br />\n</b><a class=\"waffle-rich-text-link\" data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=\"https://patents.google.com/patent/US20220389694A1/en?oq=US+20220389694+A1\" data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=\"font-size:12px;color:#0000ff;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:'docs-Varela Round';font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;\">Smart shower head</a></p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff51f58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ff51f58\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">Name & Age of Inventors (at the time of innovation):<br />\n</b>Ameer Syedibrahim (15)<br />\nAmjad Syedibrahim (15)<br />\nSyed Shah Ekramullah Alvi (15)<br />\nSidra Ambreen (16)<br />\nHiba Khan (14)<br />\nZainab Khan (15)</p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c316104 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c316104\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>Problem Statement:</b></p>\n<blockquote><p>Over 3 billion gallons of clean water are wasted annually in the USA as people wait for hot water in showers during the winter.</p></blockquote>\n<p>There is an urgent need for a solution that conserves water, reduces energy consumption, and eliminates unnecessary wait times in showers. This wastage not only strains natural resources but also increases utility bills for households. A smart, energy-efficient system is needed to deliver instant hot water while minimizing water loss.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3d6a36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3d6a36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>About the Innovation:</b></p>\n<blockquote><p><span style=\"color: #339966;\"><strong>Young inventors from DiscoverSTEM developed a smart shower head to stop wasting water while waiting for the warm water to reach from the heater to the shower.</strong></span></p></blockquote>\n<p>The shower head has a special coil that warms the water instantly when the tap is turned on. A sensor detects when hot water is needed, and once the main water supply provides hot water, the coil turns off. This invention saves water, energy, and time, while giving you a comfortable shower experience.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3d6a36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3d6a36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>Patent Certificate:<br />\n</b></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1731 size-large\" src=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-18-Smart-shower-head-min-1024x674.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"674\" srcset=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-18-Smart-shower-head-min-1024x674.jpg 1024w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-18-Smart-shower-head-min-300x197.jpg 300w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-18-Smart-shower-head-min-768x505.jpg 768w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-18-Smart-shower-head-min-1536x1011.jpg 1536w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Patent-18-Smart-shower-head-min.jpg 1900w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-abf0979 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"abf0979\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>US Patent Grant Date:<br />\n</b>March 19, 2024</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9db1b4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9db1b4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>United States Patent Number:<br />\n</b>11933029</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9536474 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9536474\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">To Read Patent Details:</b></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-adf2ee8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"adf2ee8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p>Click Here <a href=\"https://image-ppubs.uspto.gov/dirsearch-public/print/downloadPdf/20220389694\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">USPTO</a> | <a href=\"https://patents.google.com/patent/US20220389694A1/en?oq=US+20220389694+A1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Patents</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
