    "publishedDate": "03 Mar 2024",
    "description": "Akansh bags First Prize and Special Award at DRSEF 2024",
    "content": "<p><strong>Congratulations to DiscoverSTEM Student Akansh! He has bagged the First Prize in the category ‘Biomedical Engineering & Computational Biology and Bioinformatics’.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>He also received a special award from The Lemelson Foundation (Broadcom MASTERS) | Lemelson Early Inventor Prize at the Dallas Regional Science Fair. He is advancing to Texas State Science Fair which will be held in March at Texas A&M.</strong></p>\n"
