    "content": "<p><strong>Congratulations to Nakshatra and Advaita Piduri, students of our ILM program. These innovators went to state for Destination Imagination, receiving first place in regionals. Destination Imagination is a problem solving educational opportunity competition designed to nurture innovative problem solvers!</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Nakshatra additionally received a Magellan award for competing in all challenges!</strong></p>\n"
