    "title": "High-speed pressure based propulsion system for transporting resources",
    "image": ASSETS.IMAGES.MEDIACENTER_POSTS_USA_14_DISCOVERSTEM_PATENT_THUMBNAILS_MIN,
    "time": "2 Min",
    "readTime": "2 Min",
    "author": "Admin",
    "comments": 0,
    "views": "0",
    "publishedDate": "02 Jan 2024",
    "description": "A high-speed pressure-based propulsion system for transporting resources. The system facilitates movement by use of fast-speed hyperloop technology",
    "content": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">Innovation Title:<br />\n</b>High-speed pressure based propulsion system for transporting resources</p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff51f58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ff51f58\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">Name & Age of Inventors (at the time of innovation):<br />\n</b>Summan Rahman (15)<br />\nAiman Rahman (15)<br />\nDaanish Sheikh (16)<br />\nRoohie Sheikh (14)<br />\nRidah Shaista Shanavas (15)</p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c316104 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c316104\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>Problem Statement:</b></p>\n<blockquote><p>Existing transportation methods are often too costly, slow, and contribute to global warming.</p></blockquote>\n<p>These inefficiencies result in economic losses and environmental harm, making current transportation models unsustainable. There is a need for high-speed transportation powered by wind energy. Additionally, traditional systems rely heavily on non-renewable resources, creating a dependency that becomes increasingly problematic as these resources deplete. The transportation sector also faces growing challenges from congestion in urban areas, further reducing efficiency.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3d6a36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3d6a36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>About the Innovation:</b></p>\n<blockquote><p><span style=\"color: #339966;\"><strong>Young innovators at DiscoverSTEM developed an efficient propulsion system for transporting resources using wind energy. </strong></span></p></blockquote>\n<p>A windmill compresses air, which is then released in the hyperloop to propel pods at high speeds. This air compression system provides the necessary pressure for fast transportation, making the solution more sustainable, energy-efficient, and eco-friendly. The innovation also incorporates advanced storage mechanisms that maintain consistent energy supply despite wind fluctuations. Their design features modular components that can be easily scaled to meet varying transportation demands.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3d6a36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3d6a36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>Patent Certificate:<br />\n</b></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1212 size-large\" src=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Patent-14-High-Speed-Propulsion-min-1-1024x674.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"487\" srcset=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Patent-14-High-Speed-Propulsion-min-1-1024x674.jpg 1024w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Patent-14-High-Speed-Propulsion-min-1-300x197.jpg 300w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Patent-14-High-Speed-Propulsion-min-1-768x505.jpg 768w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Patent-14-High-Speed-Propulsion-min-1-1536x1011.jpg 1536w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Patent-14-High-Speed-Propulsion-min-1.jpg 1900w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 740px) 100vw, 740px\" /></p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-abf0979 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"abf0979\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>US Patent Grant Date:<br />\n</b>January 2, 2024</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9db1b4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9db1b4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>United States Patent Number:<br />\n</b>11858756</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-adf2ee8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"adf2ee8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>To Read Patent Details:<br />\n</b>Click Here <a href=\"https://image-ppubs.uspto.gov/dirsearch-public/print/downloadPdf/11858756\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">USPTO</a> | <a href=\"https://patents.google.com/patent/US20220388788A1/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Patents</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
  , "videoUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/3k2u_Iv03Ns?feature=oembed"
