    "publishedDate": "02 Jan 2024",
    "description": "An apparatus for sanitising products during the entry and exit of a housing space.",
    "content": "<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">Innovation Title:<br />\n</b>Apparatus for sanitising products</p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ff51f58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ff51f58\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">Name & Age of Inventors (at the time of innovation):<br />\n</b>Kayla Goodrich (12)<br />\nManish Rangan (13)<br />\nMuhammad Sayed (15)<br />\nBenjamin Stafford (14)<br />\nZaina Iqbal (12)<br />\nShayan Iqbal (11)<br />\nKenny Joel DeCay Jr. (15)<br />\nOmar Eido (8)</p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c316104 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c316104\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>Problem Statement:</b></p>\n<blockquote><p>Products at a supermarket are often touched by people before being purchased.</p></blockquote>\n<p>These products can become contaminated if touched by an infected person, leading to potential health hazards for families. There is a pressing need for a system that disinfects supermarket items at the register before they are brought home.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3d6a36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3d6a36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>About the Innovation:</b></p>\n<blockquote><p><span style=\"color: #339966;\"><strong>Young inventors from DiscoverSTEM developed an innovative apparatus that uses UV-C light and conveyor belts to sanitize products effectively.</strong></span></p></blockquote>\n<p>Items enter the machine, where UV-C light kills harmful bacteria and viruses from all sides. Conveyor belts move the products through the apparatus for about a couple of seconds, ensuring thorough sanitization. Reflective strips and glass base help UV-C light reach all sides of the items. Once sanitized, the products are handed over to the customer.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3d6a36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3d6a36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>Patent Certificate:<br />\n</b></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1214 size-large\" src=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Patent-16-Apparatus-Sanitising-min-1-1024x674.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"487\" srcset=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Patent-16-Apparatus-Sanitising-min-1-1024x674.jpg 1024w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Patent-16-Apparatus-Sanitising-min-1-300x197.jpg 300w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Patent-16-Apparatus-Sanitising-min-1-768x505.jpg 768w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Patent-16-Apparatus-Sanitising-min-1-1536x1011.jpg 1536w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Patent-16-Apparatus-Sanitising-min-1.jpg 1900w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 740px) 100vw, 740px\" /></p>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-abf0979 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"abf0979\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>US Patent Grant Date:<br />\n</b>January 2, 2024</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9db1b4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9db1b4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>United States Patent Number:<br />\n</b>11857687</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-adf2ee8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"adf2ee8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p><b>To Read Patent Details:<br />\n</b>Click Here <a href=\"https://image-ppubs.uspto.gov/dirsearch-public/print/downloadPdf/11857687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">USPTO</a> | <a href=\"https://patents.google.com/patent/US20230066405A1/en?inventor=mirza+faizan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Patents</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
  , "videoUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/44kwPMbH67o?feature=oembed"
