    "content": "\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>“My favorite part about coming to DiscoverSTEM are the questions and how it makes me think. I also like the people. The best part of class is talking about the different ways everybody would solve the problem.”</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"618\" height=\"890\" src=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Maahi1-min.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1043\" srcset=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Maahi1-min.jpg 618w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Maahi1-min-208x300.jpg 208w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 618px) 100vw, 618px\" /></figure>\n"
