    "description": "5-year old Sophia is one of our youngest innovators at DiscoverSTEM",
    "content": "\n<p>Sophia Abdellatif is our newest, and youngest, member of our DIP/ILM Team – Isaac Newton!</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1258\" height=\"1600\" src=\"https://discoverstem.info/extranews/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/WhatsApp-Image-2023-12-18-at-23.04.27_fd3b5010-min.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-889\" srcset=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/WhatsApp-Image-2023-12-18-at-23.04.27_fd3b5010-min.jpg 1258w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/WhatsApp-Image-2023-12-18-at-23.04.27_fd3b5010-min-236x300.jpg 236w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/WhatsApp-Image-2023-12-18-at-23.04.27_fd3b5010-min-805x1024.jpg 805w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/WhatsApp-Image-2023-12-18-at-23.04.27_fd3b5010-min-768x977.jpg 768w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/WhatsApp-Image-2023-12-18-at-23.04.27_fd3b5010-min-1208x1536.jpg 1208w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1258px) 100vw, 1258px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1872\" height=\"1368\" src=\"https://discoverstem.info/extranews/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Sophia-min.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-887\" srcset=\"https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Sophia-min.jpg 1872w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Sophia-min-300x219.jpg 300w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Sophia-min-1024x748.jpg 1024w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Sophia-min-768x561.jpg 768w, https://mediacenter.discoverstem.info/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Sophia-min-1536x1122.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1872px) 100vw, 1872px\" /></figure>\n"
