    "description": "All About STEM Radio Show is an international STEM broadcast focused on STEM education and STEM literacy.",
    "content": "<p>All About STEM Radio Show from Fishbowl Radio Network</p>\n<p>Dr. Mary Payton serves as the producer and host of the All About STEM Radio Show an international STEM broadcast focused on STEM education and STEM literacy. The show had access to 2.7 million listeners a month. The All About STEM Radio Show supports administrators, teachers, parents, students and organizations that support STEM. The show has the support of STEM professionals throughout the U.S., England, Vietnam, India, Tanzania, the UAE and seven other countries.</p>\n"
